            <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Where are DediRock's data centers located?</h3>
            <p>DediRock runs in Buffalo, New York (the BUF1 facility in Western New York) and Los Angeles, California. The i9 Dream VPS line and the RAID 5/6 storage VPS line are served from these two US locations, with an AMD Ryzen line announced as coming soon.</p>
