            <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Is DediRock VPS good for gaming servers?</h3>
            <p>Yes — that is DediRock's stated target. The i9 Dream line uses Intel i9 vCores with DDR5 RAM and NVMe storage, and DediRock advertises exceptional single-core performance for gaming, development, database scaling, rendering, and resource-heavy applications.</p>
